WEBVTT

01:29.260 --> 01:34.360
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.840 --> 01:37.789
[Episode 24]

02:06.500 --> 02:08.560
What kind of medicine are you taking?

02:35.550 --> 02:37.280
Is this why you asked me to come?

02:40.160 --> 02:40.950
What else?

02:42.920 --> 02:44.780
It couldn't be because I love you.

02:49.860 --> 02:52.940
♪ People ask me how to heal ♪

02:54.900 --> 02:58.770
♪ But what's the point
of questioning the leaving? ♪

03:02.080 --> 03:05.090
♪ Naiveness is always used
in the wrong place ♪

03:07.640 --> 03:11.060
♪ Sadly, I didn't notice anything ♪

03:18.390 --> 03:20.270
♪ The panic in your steps ♪

03:20.820 --> 03:23.579
♪ Is the symphony named betrayal ♪

03:30.500 --> 03:32.750
♪ Your silent answer ♪

03:33.500 --> 03:38.829
♪ Is the confusion
that pushed me to the valley bottom ♪

03:37.750 --> 03:38.720
Do you think

03:38.720 --> 03:39.880
this makes us even?

03:38.960 --> 03:41.740
♪ Me and myself ♪

03:42.410 --> 03:44.820
♪ The unsettled self ♪

03:45.340 --> 03:47.500
♪ Dancing at night ♪

03:47.530 --> 03:50.910
♪ I want to calm my broken heart ♪

03:51.430 --> 03:54.020
♪ Looking at myself ♪

03:54.610 --> 03:57.130
♪ With those traces of being teased ♪

03:57.500 --> 04:03.560
♪ I want to show my love
but I always step on the glass ♪

04:03.890 --> 04:06.630
♪ If promises can't be broken ♪

04:09.980 --> 04:12.770
♪ If true love can't be abandoned ♪

04:14.860 --> 04:18.950
♪ I'm the only one left to heal myself ♪

04:22.220 --> 04:25.440
♪ People ask me how to heal ♪

04:26.880 --> 04:31.480
♪ But what's the use of waking up the one
who pretends to be drunk? ♪

04:34.260 --> 04:37.600
♪ Expectation are always used
on the wrong occasions ♪

04:39.710 --> 04:43.490
♪ Sadly, I didn't reject anything ♪

04:50.560 --> 04:52.920
♪ The panic in your steps ♪

04:53.150 --> 04:55.900
♪ Is the symphony named betrayal ♪

05:02.810 --> 05:05.100
♪ Your silent answer ♪

05:05.860 --> 05:11.000
♪ Is the confusion
that pushed me to the valley bottom ♪

05:11.390 --> 05:14.310
♪ Me and myself ♪

05:14.710 --> 05:17.370
♪ The unsettled self ♪

05:17.720 --> 05:19.870
♪ Dancing at night ♪

05:19.940 --> 05:23.190
♪ I want to calm my broken heart ♪

05:23.780 --> 05:26.670
♪ Looking at myself ♪

05:27.020 --> 05:29.380
♪ With those traces of being teased ♪

05:29.880 --> 05:35.750
♪ I want to show my love
but I always step on the glass ♪

05:35.970 --> 05:39.040
♪ If promises can't be broken ♪

05:42.190 --> 05:45.340
♪ If true love can't be abandoned ♪

06:17.710 --> 06:20.800
♪ If true love can't be abandoned ♪

06:22.560 --> 06:26.800
♪ I'm the only one left to heal myself ♪

06:47.400 --> 06:48.530
Breakfast is ready.

06:50.110 --> 06:51.520
Today is the kickoff meeting

06:51.520 --> 06:52.750
for the Lan Yue Phase II project.

06:52.750 --> 06:53.750
It is also your first official day

06:53.750 --> 06:55.880
as the director's special assistant.

06:57.310 --> 06:59.720
There's about...

07:01.190 --> 07:02.120
30 minutes to go.

07:04.870 --> 07:05.730
I'll go change.

07:12.750 --> 07:13.650
Today

07:13.720 --> 07:16.110
marks the official launch

07:16.750 --> 07:18.640
of Phase II of the Lan Yue Resort,

07:18.750 --> 07:20.810
Lan Yue Cloud Dwelling Secret Realm.

07:26.670 --> 07:28.640
For the company, this project

07:28.640 --> 07:30.720
is a vital step in our strategic layout

07:30.720 --> 07:32.710
and a benchmark key project.

07:33.430 --> 07:34.110
I know that

07:34.430 --> 07:35.870
over the past few months,

07:35.990 --> 07:38.140
from planning to bidding,

07:38.230 --> 07:39.790
you have all overcome many challenges.

07:39.790 --> 07:41.960
On behalf of Lan Yue,

07:42.110 --> 07:43.920
I extend my sincere gratitude

07:43.920 --> 07:45.980
to everyone involved in the project,

08:00.990 --> 08:01.720
Hello, miss.

08:01.720 --> 08:03.040
How can I help you?

08:03.430 --> 08:04.560
It's my first day here.

08:04.560 --> 08:06.020
I haven't got my badge yet.

08:06.750 --> 08:08.880
Then please register first.

08:07.030 --> 08:12.490
[Lan Yue Group]

08:09.230 --> 08:10.920
I'll look up your name.

08:10.920 --> 08:11.670
What's your name?

08:11.670 --> 08:12.310
Zhou Wan.

08:12.990 --> 08:14.110
Which Zhou?

08:14.990 --> 08:16.990
The Zhou as in Zhou, Wu, Zheng, Wang.

08:16.990 --> 08:17.640
And Wan?

08:21.080 --> 08:23.010
Jun, why isn't the search working?

08:23.040 --> 08:23.870
I don't know either.

08:23.870 --> 08:25.190
I just started too.

08:26.230 --> 08:27.630
Please wait a moment.

08:27.920 --> 08:28.720
In the future,

08:28.840 --> 08:30.700
we will be driven by innovation

08:30.960 --> 08:32.620
and guided by customer needs.

08:32.760 --> 08:34.000
Let's move forward hand in hand

08:34.000 --> 08:36.880
and step into this journey full of

08:36.880 --> 08:39.210
opportunities and challenges together.

08:39.520 --> 08:42.270
Great, great, great.

08:42.340 --> 08:45.700
[Cloud Dwelling Secret Realm]
[Phase II Resort of Lan Yue Group]

08:43.830 --> 08:45.190
Next, please allow me

08:45.190 --> 08:46.360
to introduce to you

08:46.360 --> 08:47.360
the core members of

08:47.360 --> 08:48.820
our Phase II project team.

08:53.830 --> 08:54.710
Sorry, sorry.

08:54.710 --> 08:56.070
I'm so sorry I'm late.

09:01.550 --> 09:02.120
Come.

09:03.830 --> 09:04.590
First up

09:04.590 --> 09:06.040
is someone we are all very familiar with,

09:05.940 --> 09:09.270
[Cloud Dwelling Secret Realm]
[Phase II Resort of Lan Yue Group]

09:06.040 --> 09:07.310
our Project Director,

09:07.590 --> 09:09.190
Lu Xixiao, Mr. Lu Jr.

09:13.520 --> 09:16.000
Deputy Project Director
and Special Assistant to the Director,

09:16.000 --> 09:16.920
Zhou Wan.

09:19.740 --> 09:21.190
[Cloud Dwelling Secret Realm]
[Phase II Resort of Lan Yue Group]

09:21.790 --> 09:23.450
Hello everyone, I am Zhou Wan.

09:23.590 --> 09:25.990
Project engineering manager, Cheng Feng.

09:28.520 --> 09:30.000
Sorry to interrupt.

09:30.680 --> 09:31.280
Ms. Qilan.

09:35.000 --> 09:37.180
To facilitate communication
between the Phase II project team

09:37.180 --> 09:39.750
and headquarters,

09:39.820 --> 09:42.020
the board of directors has decided,

09:42.190 --> 09:44.600
and in accordance
with company regulations,

09:44.600 --> 09:45.400
to appoint

09:45.840 --> 09:47.580
Strategic Director, Mr. Jiang Yan,

09:47.580 --> 09:49.180
to join the Phase II project.

09:49.380 --> 09:50.180
Let's hear it!

09:52.310 --> 09:54.190
Director Jiang

09:54.190 --> 09:56.550
graduated from the Architecture Department
of Huaqing University.

09:56.550 --> 09:57.640
He has worked at

09:57.640 --> 09:59.520
several well-known

09:59.520 --> 10:01.520
real estate groups in the industry.

10:01.590 --> 10:02.880
I believe his addition

10:02.950 --> 10:04.360
will definitely make our Phase II project

10:04.360 --> 10:05.880
even stronger.

10:08.060 --> 10:08.870
Great!

10:17.900 --> 10:19.960
Looking forward to working with you.

10:26.120 --> 10:27.120
Likewise.

10:29.950 --> 10:30.760
Great!

10:47.240 --> 10:48.100
Please come in.

10:49.670 --> 10:51.600
I'm glad to be colleagues with you.

10:54.550 --> 10:55.310
I had no idea

10:55.310 --> 10:57.370
you'd join the Phase II project team.

10:57.920 --> 10:58.590
You...

10:59.430 --> 11:01.470
Mr. Lu made a last-minute decision.

11:02.400 --> 11:03.930
I'm just following orders.

11:08.070 --> 11:09.590
Then I'll rely on
your guidance from now on,

11:09.590 --> 11:11.000
Director Jiang.

11:15.040 --> 11:17.040
Want to go home together after work?

11:17.950 --> 11:19.380
I still have a lot to do.

11:19.470 --> 11:20.710
You go ahead when you get off work.

11:20.710 --> 11:22.240
It's fine. I'll wait for you.

11:22.240 --> 11:24.570
Riding with me
is better than taking a cab.

11:26.040 --> 11:26.670
Jiang Yan.

11:28.430 --> 11:29.640
Lately,

11:31.360 --> 11:32.420
I'm not going home.

11:33.470 --> 11:35.920
Not going home? What do you mean?

11:39.670 --> 11:40.550
Zhou Wan.

11:42.040 --> 11:42.760
Excuse me.

11:48.360 --> 11:49.890
What's wrong, Director Lu?

11:51.790 --> 11:52.790
Are you that free?

11:53.520 --> 11:54.650
If you're that free,

11:56.160 --> 11:57.560
go make me a cup of coffee.

12:02.950 --> 12:03.950
Yes, Director Lu.

12:10.070 --> 12:12.040
What's the background
of this Director Jiang?

12:12.040 --> 12:13.040
He was handpicked by Mr. Lu

12:13.040 --> 12:13.950
to join Lan Yue.

12:13.950 --> 12:15.430
Don't you get the connection?

12:15.430 --> 12:16.570
I don't get it.

12:16.710 --> 12:17.360
Mr. Lu Jr.

12:17.360 --> 12:18.580
is Mr. Lu's son.

12:18.630 --> 12:19.880
And Ms. Qilan trusts Mr. Lu Jr.

12:19.880 --> 12:21.590
But Director Jiang is on Mr. Lu's side.

12:21.590 --> 12:22.640
What kind of complex

12:22.640 --> 12:24.190
family business drama is this?

12:24.190 --> 12:25.040
It's normal you don't get it.

12:25.040 --> 12:26.660
It's very complicated.

12:26.830 --> 12:27.760
Let me tell you.

12:27.760 --> 12:29.990
That Zhou Wan is a tough one.

12:30.160 --> 12:30.880
She used to be

12:30.880 --> 12:32.430
the top star at Boxing Construction.

12:32.430 --> 12:33.550
She competed fiercely

12:33.550 --> 12:35.010
with Dingshang.

12:35.240 --> 12:36.470
Now she's at Dingshang,

12:36.470 --> 12:37.950
clinging to the person in charge,

12:37.950 --> 12:39.360
and even became the deputy director.

12:39.360 --> 12:41.220
Her tricks are really something.

12:41.240 --> 12:42.070
Oh my.

12:42.830 --> 12:43.590
Are you going to work or not?

12:43.590 --> 12:45.120
What are you talking about?

12:46.670 --> 12:48.270
Do you all have nothing to do?

12:58.790 --> 13:00.130
Come on, you.

13:01.040 --> 13:02.360
They were chatting in here,

13:02.360 --> 13:04.070
and you just stood there listening?

13:04.070 --> 13:05.120
After so many years in the workplace,

13:05.120 --> 13:06.430
I stopped caring a long time ago.

13:06.430 --> 13:07.860
They don't pay my salary.

13:08.280 --> 13:09.480
Why bother with them?

13:12.950 --> 13:14.840
Director Lu, your coffee.

13:31.880 --> 13:34.140
What do you want to eat?
I'll cook for you.

13:34.920 --> 13:35.710
Anything.

13:37.280 --> 13:39.280
I don't know how to cook "anything".

13:42.280 --> 13:42.950
Will you cook

13:42.950 --> 13:44.210
whatever I want to eat?

13:46.160 --> 13:47.020
All right then.

13:47.920 --> 13:49.480
I want Buddha Jumps Over the Wall,

13:49.480 --> 13:50.250
Dongpo pork,

13:50.830 --> 13:52.230
Wellington steak,

13:52.550 --> 13:53.590
Spanish paella,

13:53.590 --> 13:54.850
and beef bourguignon.

13:55.590 --> 13:57.450
Just make any of them for me to try.

14:01.520 --> 14:02.360
I'm sorry.

14:03.400 --> 14:04.770
I'm out of groceries.

14:11.000 --> 14:12.800
You can only have noodles today.

14:13.470 --> 14:14.490
Next time I go to the supermarket

14:14.490 --> 14:15.760
and buy some ingredients,

14:15.760 --> 14:17.090
I'll make you a big meal.

14:49.280 --> 14:50.920
Wellington steak,

14:50.950 --> 14:52.830
Buddha Jumps Over the Wall, whatever.

14:52.830 --> 14:53.760
It's all in here.

14:54.400 --> 14:55.040
Eat up.

14:56.640 --> 14:58.100
Where are the chopsticks?

15:07.470 --> 15:08.830
Unwashed chopsticks.

15:12.470 --> 15:13.040
Wait.

15:14.310 --> 15:16.640
Let me add some spoiled scallions for you.

15:18.950 --> 15:20.550
I guarantee it tastes awful.

15:20.830 --> 15:22.080
You think I don't dare to eat it?

15:22.080 --> 15:22.750
Then eat it.

15:26.400 --> 15:27.190
I will.

15:37.680 --> 15:38.940
It doesn't taste good.

15:40.790 --> 15:42.520
I told you it would taste awful.

15:46.160 --> 15:47.690
What happened to your hand?

15:49.640 --> 15:51.000
From cooking for you.

15:51.790 --> 15:52.830
It burned me.

15:56.950 --> 15:58.360
When I was working part-time in college,

15:58.360 --> 15:59.830
I never got burned.

16:00.160 --> 16:02.000
But I ended up getting hurt here.

16:04.040 --> 16:05.300
You worked part-time?

16:06.670 --> 16:08.470
Who would support me if I didn't?

16:14.950 --> 16:15.790
Eat it.

16:28.440 --> 16:29.970
Who did you learn this from?

16:31.590 --> 16:33.880
I told you, at a noodle shop.

16:39.240 --> 16:42.110
I just help out at the noodle shop,

16:42.430 --> 16:44.040
cleaning up and stuff.

16:44.450 --> 16:46.090
I also tutor occasionally.

16:53.280 --> 16:54.000
Move over.

16:54.920 --> 16:56.120
Move over, I'll do it.

16:56.790 --> 16:57.710
Go eat.

16:57.710 --> 16:58.430
I'll do it.

16:58.430 --> 17:01.400
-I can’t choke you if you don’t eat.
-That's nowhere near enough noodles.

17:01.400 --> 17:02.730
And it tastes terrible.

17:03.040 --> 17:03.760
Move over.

17:06.750 --> 17:08.670
Fine, wash them if you want.

17:08.670 --> 17:09.800
You can wash the dishes from now on.

17:09.800 --> 17:12.140
You worked part-time
with these cooking skills?

17:12.140 --> 17:14.800
How was that place
supposed to stay in business?

17:15.470 --> 17:17.530
The restaurant I worked at in college

17:17.990 --> 17:19.849
was the most popular noodle shop.

17:21.950 --> 17:23.609
Before you went there, right?

19:02.750 --> 19:03.190
Sit.

19:17.880 --> 19:18.400
Sit.

19:39.430 --> 19:42.320
♪ I'mma take a frozen heart ♪

19:43.290 --> 19:45.540
♪ Someone's gonna make it ♪

19:46.040 --> 19:49.260
♪ In the building of my broken part ♪

19:50.160 --> 19:52.700
♪ Someone's gonna fix it ♪

19:53.030 --> 19:57.270
♪ I'm the only one guy
with the ten things crime ♪

19:57.540 --> 20:01.440
♪ I deserve a sanction in my mind ♪

20:02.830 --> 20:04.230
♪ Nescience doesn't mean ♪

20:04.260 --> 20:05.970
♪ That I can fly ♪

20:08.550 --> 20:10.910
♪ But I never seem to close ♪

20:10.930 --> 20:13.640
♪ The dormer lock ♪

20:15.360 --> 20:18.690
♪ Tell you starts were above the floor ♪

20:44.950 --> 20:46.670
Wan, I have an emergency.

20:46.670 --> 20:47.400
Wan.

20:47.560 --> 20:48.690
What's wrong, Meng?

20:50.030 --> 20:51.920
Your house suddenly lost all power.

20:51.920 --> 20:52.550
I am currently experiencing

20:52.550 --> 20:54.550
primitive candlelight nightlife.

20:56.160 --> 20:58.120
That building is too old.

20:59.120 --> 20:59.920
Don't worry.

20:59.920 --> 21:01.030
Check and see if it's

21:01.030 --> 21:02.960
an issue with the circuit breaker.

21:11.840 --> 21:13.900
No, the power switch hasn't tripped.

21:14.470 --> 21:16.690
Maybe the wiring is aging.

21:18.080 --> 21:19.140
In that case, Meng,

21:19.190 --> 21:20.320
you can't use electricity anymore.

21:20.320 --> 21:21.450
It's too dangerous.

21:21.470 --> 21:23.710
Then how long will it take to fix?

21:24.400 --> 21:27.080
We'll have to inspect everything first,

21:27.080 --> 21:28.140
then reinstall it.

21:28.510 --> 21:30.750
I don't think it can be solved

21:30.750 --> 21:32.030
anytime soon.

21:34.110 --> 21:34.970
How about this?

21:35.510 --> 21:36.840
I'll let you use my employee discount

21:36.840 --> 21:38.100
at our group's hotels.

21:38.230 --> 21:39.030
No.

21:39.120 --> 21:40.360
Your employee discount

21:40.360 --> 21:41.320
only has a quota of a few thousand.

21:41.320 --> 21:42.470
I won't use it.

21:42.600 --> 21:44.030
Keep it for yourself.

21:44.430 --> 21:45.630
I have a place to stay.

21:46.360 --> 21:46.820
Well...

21:46.920 --> 21:47.840
Um, do you have

21:47.840 --> 21:49.120
any extra candles?

21:49.120 --> 21:50.600
I can't find any.

21:51.080 --> 21:52.710
I'm out of candles too.

21:53.190 --> 21:54.320
I have to go buy some.

21:55.670 --> 21:56.880
It's fine. Forget it.

21:56.880 --> 21:58.410
I'll figure something out.

21:59.230 --> 22:00.640
Then WeChat me anytime.

22:01.230 --> 22:01.880
Bye.

22:01.880 --> 22:03.640
Okay, bye.

22:17.470 --> 22:18.190
Meng.

22:20.030 --> 22:21.120
Lu Xixiao?

22:22.510 --> 22:23.840
He's asleep.

22:28.080 --> 22:29.030
Who is it?

22:29.030 --> 22:30.080
What time is it?

22:30.080 --> 22:31.740
Look at the time when you call.

22:32.120 --> 22:32.950
Calling at this hour.

22:32.950 --> 22:34.120
So noisy.

22:34.120 --> 22:34.990
How can I sleep?

22:36.510 --> 22:37.800
You touched my hand

22:37.800 --> 22:39.230
while I was asleep.

22:42.510 --> 22:43.110
How did...

22:46.230 --> 22:49.430
-You pretended to be asleep.
-You pretended to be asleep.

22:49.990 --> 22:50.750
Why?

22:51.920 --> 22:52.430
You called me here

22:52.430 --> 22:53.600
just to make me a maid?

22:53.600 --> 22:55.270
You owe me. You deserve it.

22:57.030 --> 22:59.230
Apply the medicine yourself next time.

22:59.920 --> 23:01.320
I'm going to walk the dog.

23:02.360 --> 23:03.310
Are you coming?

23:06.950 --> 23:07.820
Suit yourself.

23:07.850 --> 23:09.120
I've been walking him myself for years.

23:09.120 --> 23:10.270
Let's go, Xiaoliu.

23:12.360 --> 23:14.290
I'll just keep walking him myself.

23:14.470 --> 23:15.270
I walk him in the morning,

23:15.270 --> 23:15.920
in the afternoon,

23:15.920 --> 23:17.470
and at midnight. Let's go.

23:24.940 --> 23:26.310
Wait for me.

23:26.880 --> 23:29.380
How can a puppy walk a puppy?

23:40.360 --> 23:40.990
Xiaoliu.

23:41.240 --> 23:42.710
Do you have something to say?

23:42.710 --> 23:43.510
Stop.

23:44.360 --> 23:45.160
It said stop.

23:45.640 --> 23:46.230
Xiaoliu.

23:47.320 --> 23:47.850
Xiaoliu.

23:50.270 --> 23:50.750
Sit.

23:51.750 --> 23:52.190
Sit.

23:53.030 --> 23:53.510
Bark.

23:54.750 --> 23:56.430
It doesn't listen to you at all.

23:56.430 --> 23:57.160
It has something to say.

23:57.160 --> 23:58.820
It's just too shy to say it now.

23:59.950 --> 24:00.510
What?

24:03.120 --> 24:04.250
It says it's thirsty

24:04.320 --> 24:05.450
and wants some milk.

24:07.190 --> 24:07.880
Yes, sir.

24:12.710 --> 24:13.990
Good dog, Xiaoliu.

24:21.120 --> 24:21.920
It can't walk anymore.

24:21.920 --> 24:23.520
I can't walk anymore either.

24:25.950 --> 24:26.870
Wait.

24:26.950 --> 24:28.950
Is this how you take care of Xiaoliu?

24:28.950 --> 24:30.160
What do you mean by that?

24:30.160 --> 24:31.430
What if it falls off later?

24:31.430 --> 24:32.560
Do you see it falling off?

24:32.560 --> 24:33.990
Are you really going to ride home?

24:33.990 --> 24:34.670
Yeah.

24:49.360 --> 24:50.600
Who let you work here?

24:52.750 --> 24:54.480
Working is not allowed at home.

24:55.400 --> 24:56.530
Go warm up some milk.

25:04.920 --> 25:05.560
Okay.

25:21.560 --> 25:23.120
Drink less, Xiaoliu.

25:23.230 --> 25:25.000
You can only drink a little.

25:30.800 --> 25:31.600
Where's mine?

25:33.840 --> 25:35.070
You can drink with it.

25:52.870 --> 25:53.590
Go to sleep.

25:56.600 --> 25:57.670
I want to work here.

25:57.670 --> 25:58.800
I want to sleep here.

26:00.120 --> 26:01.230
I want to work here.

26:01.230 --> 26:02.360
I want to sleep here.

26:06.510 --> 26:07.340
Then I'll go somewhere else.

26:07.340 --> 26:07.930
No.

26:08.770 --> 26:09.570
Stay here.

26:10.950 --> 26:11.750
Time to sleep.

26:18.670 --> 26:19.800
You're impossible.

26:24.750 --> 26:25.840
Didn't I tell you

26:25.840 --> 26:27.160
when you agents come to see the house,

26:27.160 --> 26:28.560
you have to let me know?

26:28.560 --> 26:30.490
And you didn't even close the door.

26:32.470 --> 26:33.470
Why are you here?

26:34.160 --> 26:35.270
This is my house.

26:35.270 --> 26:36.670
Why do you think I'm here?

26:36.750 --> 26:38.210
How is it your house again?

26:38.270 --> 26:40.000
I paid half of the down payment.

26:41.320 --> 26:41.920
By the way.

26:42.240 --> 26:43.640
Aren't you at your boss's beck and call?

26:43.640 --> 26:45.030
Is there no signal at home?

26:45.030 --> 26:46.490
How did you get kicked out?

26:50.560 --> 26:51.640
Didn't you say you'd sell the house

26:51.640 --> 26:52.470
and never see me again?

26:52.470 --> 26:53.670
Why did you come back?

26:55.030 --> 26:56.290
None of your business.

27:09.510 --> 27:11.110
I want to stay in the bedroom.

27:11.120 --> 27:11.510
Go ahead.

27:11.510 --> 27:13.840
If you don't mind
the hard tiles, go ahead.

27:31.670 --> 27:32.840
What are you mumbling about?

27:32.840 --> 27:33.970
I don't understand.

27:36.560 --> 27:37.420
If you take the blanket inside,

27:37.420 --> 27:38.540
where will I sleep?

27:38.750 --> 27:40.150
Sleep wherever you want.

27:41.990 --> 27:42.950
Can you be reasonable,

27:42.950 --> 27:43.640
Gu Meng?

27:46.470 --> 27:46.990
Wan.

27:47.360 --> 27:48.430
Here is the compiled list

27:48.430 --> 27:49.600
of all the qualified

27:49.600 --> 27:50.400
enterprises.

27:50.670 --> 27:52.120
Including culture and tourism groups,

27:52.120 --> 27:52.950
commercial groups,

27:52.950 --> 27:53.560
and IP operation groups

27:53.560 --> 27:54.780
we can work with.

27:58.600 --> 27:59.470
Have you done the background checks?

27:59.470 --> 27:59.950
Yes.

28:00.840 --> 28:02.160
All enterprises on the list

28:02.160 --> 28:03.670
have no issues with their qualifications

28:03.670 --> 28:04.560
or public reputation.

28:04.560 --> 28:05.970
And there are no

28:06.000 --> 28:08.130
commercial disputes or legal issues.

28:08.270 --> 28:09.430
It seems that

28:09.840 --> 28:12.510
only Xinghai Entertainment
is more suitable.

28:13.230 --> 28:14.920
And they seem to have

28:14.920 --> 28:16.720
cooperated with Lan Yue before.

28:17.270 --> 28:18.400
Mind if I join you?

28:20.030 --> 28:20.950
Of course not.

28:22.190 --> 28:23.320
You are the Strategic Director

28:23.320 --> 28:24.600
sent by the headquarters.

28:24.600 --> 28:25.250
We also need

28:25.250 --> 28:26.780
your professional advice.

28:32.190 --> 28:33.030
Cooperating with comprehensive IP

28:33.030 --> 28:34.640
operation enterprises

28:34.880 --> 28:36.470
is indeed the safest model.

28:37.750 --> 28:39.600
They have strong
brand premium capabilities.

28:39.600 --> 28:41.470
Their IPs each
come with their own traffic.

28:41.470 --> 28:42.430
I participated in

28:42.430 --> 28:43.770
the Sky Isle Lake Resort project before.

28:43.770 --> 28:45.050
Because it introduced

28:45.160 --> 28:46.560
the Dream Star Domain IP,

28:46.640 --> 28:47.670
the annual foot traffic

28:47.670 --> 28:49.030
increased by 23%.

28:50.360 --> 28:51.400
But have you thought about

28:51.400 --> 28:52.880
how difficult it is to negotiate

28:52.880 --> 28:54.280
a partnership with them?

28:55.600 --> 28:56.400
If we try to

28:56.400 --> 28:57.710
negotiate a partnership now,

28:57.710 --> 28:58.320
we'd have to haggle

28:58.320 --> 29:00.030
for a very, very long time.

29:01.120 --> 29:02.360
Not to mention we have to pay

29:02.360 --> 29:03.600
the royalty fees.

29:04.920 --> 29:05.670
The bulk of the profits

29:05.670 --> 29:06.950
will be taken by them.

29:08.670 --> 29:09.270
How are they

29:09.270 --> 29:10.730
supposed to make a living?

29:11.840 --> 29:13.750
Director Jiang, you only know how to

29:13.750 --> 29:15.560
use past cases

29:15.880 --> 29:17.990
that cannot be 100% replicated

29:18.670 --> 29:19.510
as examples.

29:21.750 --> 29:22.610
How about this?

29:23.190 --> 29:24.920
Let's prepare both plans.

29:25.270 --> 29:26.430
If cooperation with large

29:26.430 --> 29:27.560
comprehensive operation enterprises

29:27.560 --> 29:28.870
fails,

29:29.120 --> 29:30.640
we can also choose

29:30.640 --> 29:31.880
multiple professional
intellectual property enterprises

29:31.880 --> 29:33.410
for sub-item cooperation.

29:33.600 --> 29:34.400
Exactly.

29:35.160 --> 29:37.270
We can target different business formats,

29:37.270 --> 29:38.750
choose the best partners,

29:39.320 --> 29:40.450
and bid by sub-item.

29:42.560 --> 29:44.150
Let's take a break first.

29:44.430 --> 29:45.840
I'll go make some coffee for everyone.

29:45.840 --> 29:47.470
-Okay. Thank you, Wan.
-Thank you.

29:47.470 --> 29:48.710
Good job.

29:48.710 --> 29:49.560
Take a break.

29:52.230 --> 29:53.080
Good job.

30:04.560 --> 30:05.430
Why are you speaking up for him?

30:05.430 --> 30:06.360
What do you mean?

30:08.640 --> 30:10.080
We're at the company.

30:10.080 --> 30:11.400
I was just talking about the matter.

30:11.400 --> 30:12.360
What did I do wrong?

30:12.360 --> 30:13.600
I was also just talking about the matter.

30:13.600 --> 30:14.660
What did I do wrong?

30:17.360 --> 30:19.240
I came to remind you.

30:20.320 --> 30:21.230
You'd better clearly remember

30:21.230 --> 30:22.830
your job responsibilities.

30:26.230 --> 30:27.880
Don't do this at the office.

30:27.880 --> 30:28.710
What did I do?

30:29.190 --> 30:29.920
What did I do?

30:34.320 --> 30:34.840
Clumsy.

30:34.920 --> 30:35.950
-Wait.
-Did you burn yourself?

30:35.950 --> 30:36.480
It's hot.

30:36.990 --> 30:37.880
-Stop wiping me.
-Are you okay?

30:37.880 --> 30:39.610
-Did you burn your hand?
-Wait.

30:40.230 --> 30:41.640
Your clothes are wet.
What are you going to do?

30:41.640 --> 30:43.040
It's fine. I have a spare.

30:44.490 --> 30:45.480
Excuse me.

30:48.250 --> 30:49.190
Director Lu.

30:50.330 --> 30:52.330
Go wash your hands if they are dirty.

30:55.190 --> 30:56.520
Don't bother yourself.

30:57.360 --> 30:59.560
My special assistant wiped them for me.

31:09.510 --> 31:10.120
Zhou Wan.

31:16.510 --> 31:18.110
Are you free this afternoon?

31:20.320 --> 31:21.120
What is it?

31:21.920 --> 31:23.600
My mom talks about you a lot.

31:24.030 --> 31:25.190
Would you like to go

31:25.190 --> 31:26.050
see her with me?

31:29.120 --> 31:30.560
It has indeed been many years

31:30.560 --> 31:31.840
since I saw your mom.

31:33.670 --> 31:37.080
-But I still have some...
-You haven’t seen each other for years.

31:37.080 --> 31:38.610
My mom misses you very much.

31:39.080 --> 31:40.750
And today is her birthday.

31:41.320 --> 31:42.980
How about we get off work early

31:43.400 --> 31:44.730
and go see her together?

32:00.430 --> 32:02.960
See you
in the underground garage after work!

32:08.400 --> 32:09.260
Did you hear me?

32:10.820 --> 32:11.730
What's wrong?

32:12.670 --> 32:14.360
Who is he yelling at?

32:14.380 --> 32:15.140
I don't know.

32:21.080 --> 32:22.320
I have plans tonight.

32:23.030 --> 32:24.370
I won't go back with you.

32:31.270 --> 32:33.470
Don't forget what you are supposed to do.

32:33.470 --> 32:34.540
Don't forget.

32:40.560 --> 32:42.080
What are you two looking at?

32:42.080 --> 32:42.920
What's so interesting?

32:42.920 --> 32:45.050
Haven't you seen someone on the phone?

32:46.470 --> 32:48.990
I'm going with Jiang Yan...

32:51.840 --> 32:52.900
I'll be back early.

33:00.670 --> 33:02.030
What about my dinner?

33:02.470 --> 33:04.070
Am I not going to have dinner?

33:04.160 --> 33:05.690
Where should I have dinner?

33:06.560 --> 33:08.330
Before I moved in,

33:08.920 --> 33:09.950
did you starve?

33:16.160 --> 33:17.890
Wait for me to get home and cook.

33:26.670 --> 33:27.320
All right.

33:28.270 --> 33:29.930
I'll wait for you at home then.

33:30.880 --> 33:31.750
You have the address, right?

33:31.750 --> 33:33.280
Don't go to the wrong place.

33:34.750 --> 33:35.350
All right.

33:43.410 --> 33:46.830
[Wellness Center]

33:53.990 --> 33:54.840
Hello, visitors.

33:54.840 --> 33:56.180
Please register here.

34:15.360 --> 34:16.239
I'm at the supermarket.

34:16.239 --> 34:17.239
What should I buy?

34:18.360 --> 34:19.630
Sorry, sorry.

34:21.340 --> 34:22.760
It's fine.

34:32.110 --> 34:32.630
Mom.

34:33.510 --> 34:34.280
Yan.

34:38.239 --> 34:40.030
Is this your classmate?

34:40.590 --> 34:41.110
Yes.

34:41.590 --> 34:42.260
You could've told me

34:42.260 --> 34:43.790
your classmate was coming.

34:44.159 --> 34:44.810
Hello.

34:45.550 --> 34:46.550
Hello, Ms. Jiang.

34:47.280 --> 34:48.320
Hello.

35:00.810 --> 35:03.020
You even brought me a gift.

35:03.630 --> 35:04.890
Ms. Jiang, please sit.

35:08.880 --> 35:10.610
Yan doesn't have many friends.

35:10.800 --> 35:12.140
I'm busy with work.

35:12.200 --> 35:14.930
Please spend more time
with him when you're free.

35:15.430 --> 35:16.200
He is a very

35:16.220 --> 35:17.900
filial and sensible child.

35:18.470 --> 35:19.800
Every time he visits me,

35:20.150 --> 35:22.150
he brings me a lot of delicious food.

35:22.470 --> 35:24.030
When he's busy with his studies,

35:24.030 --> 35:25.560
he lets Hei keep me company.

35:25.880 --> 35:27.440
We are good friends now.

35:44.110 --> 35:45.240
When did Ms. Jiang

35:45.990 --> 35:46.950
get diagnosed with

35:46.950 --> 35:47.760
Alzheimer's?

35:49.240 --> 35:50.700
Just in the past two years,

35:51.590 --> 35:53.200
she suddenly became forgetful

35:53.200 --> 35:55.070
and sometimes gets her memories mixed up.

35:55.070 --> 35:56.920
I took her to many hospitals,

35:57.630 --> 35:58.760
but nothing helped.

36:00.550 --> 36:01.360
However,

36:03.030 --> 36:04.430
at least she's happy now.

36:05.590 --> 36:07.450
Compared to when she was younger,

36:07.520 --> 36:08.920
she is much more relaxed.

36:09.720 --> 36:11.030
So is this the reason

36:11.240 --> 36:13.240
you decided to return to Pingchuan?

36:15.470 --> 36:16.930
That's part of the reason.

36:17.760 --> 36:19.960
My mom doesn't want to leave Pingchuan.

36:20.470 --> 36:23.070
I can spend more time
with her now that I'm back.

36:32.100 --> 36:34.320
-Ms. Jiang, you want the cake?
-Be careful.

36:34.320 --> 36:35.250
Mom, be careful.

36:36.760 --> 36:38.360
My son bought this cake.

36:38.360 --> 36:39.130
Here, have some.

36:39.130 --> 36:40.880
Thank you so much. Happy birthday.

36:40.880 --> 36:41.550
Come, have a seat.

36:41.550 --> 36:42.280
Happy birthday.

36:42.280 --> 36:43.070
Thank you. Please take a seat.

36:43.070 --> 36:44.030
Be happy, sis.

36:44.030 --> 36:44.720
Happy birthday.

36:44.720 --> 36:45.470
Thank you.

36:45.680 --> 36:47.610
Which light soy sauce should I buy?

36:49.360 --> 36:50.960
The one with zero additives.

36:51.590 --> 36:53.720
This cake has zero additives.

36:53.950 --> 36:55.280
It's really delicious.

37:12.200 --> 37:13.930
We haven't lit the candles yet.

37:14.370 --> 37:16.330
Such a filial and good son.

37:16.360 --> 37:17.090
I'm jealous.

37:22.710 --> 37:24.360
[Organic green vegetables]

37:24.360 --> 37:25.890
[Prepped Vegetables] [Sprouts]

37:30.470 --> 37:32.130
What vegetables should I buy?

37:34.950 --> 37:36.800
Buy whatever you want to eat.

37:36.820 --> 37:38.420
Organic vegetables will do.

37:46.510 --> 37:47.320
Let me help.

37:57.470 --> 37:57.950
Okay.

37:59.320 --> 38:00.240
Let's sing...

38:00.240 --> 38:01.400
-"Happy Birthday" together.
-Come on.

38:01.400 --> 38:02.430
-Okay.
-Okay.

38:02.720 --> 38:04.070
What's the difference
between free-range eggs

38:04.070 --> 38:05.170
and battery eggs?

38:06.200 --> 38:09.760
Happy birthday to you.

38:09.950 --> 38:13.360
Happy birthday to you.

38:21.680 --> 38:25.400
Happy birthday to you.

38:26.070 --> 38:29.360
Happy birthday to you.

38:56.800 --> 38:57.630
How are things

38:58.200 --> 38:59.470
with Lu Xixiao?

39:02.280 --> 39:03.140
Same as always.

39:06.280 --> 39:09.360
Did Lu Xixiao help you get into Lan Yue?

39:26.470 --> 39:27.330
Is it Lu Xixiao?

39:32.920 --> 39:35.650
Is he trying to reach you
about something urgent?

39:36.950 --> 39:38.350
It's nothing important.

39:40.240 --> 39:41.630
Why did you join Lan Yue?

39:45.880 --> 39:47.200
I have my own reasons.

39:50.320 --> 39:51.260
If you don't want to say,

39:51.260 --> 39:52.260
I won't force you.

39:53.240 --> 39:54.240
But I hope

39:54.950 --> 39:56.240
when you run into difficulties,

39:56.240 --> 39:57.300
you can think of me.

39:57.950 --> 39:59.470
Whatever Lu Xixiao can do for you,

39:59.470 --> 40:00.360
I can do too.

40:05.150 --> 40:05.840
Jiang Yan.

40:07.920 --> 40:09.320
I am very grateful to you.

40:10.630 --> 40:11.610
But some things

40:12.030 --> 40:13.280
aren't meant to be
shared or faced together,

40:13.280 --> 40:14.680
even between friends.

40:17.280 --> 40:18.480
What about Lu Xixiao?

40:23.840 --> 40:24.900
He's no exception.

40:37.360 --> 40:37.950
Zhou Wan.
